{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","src":"manifest","doc":"ErrorDescription","page":21,"text":"5.2.2.2.2 CAN Interface\nDetection\nThere is no timeout detection by CanIf\nReaction\nThere is no reaction performed by CanIf\nReport\nThe CanIf does not report any timeout event to the upper layers.\nRecovery\nThe recovery is triggered by the CAN State Manager:\n• CanIf_SetControllerMode(Controller, CANIF_CS_STARTED).\n• Can_InitController(Controller, *Config).\n• Can_SetControllerMode (Controller, CAN_T_STARTED).","caption":"5.2.2.2.2 CAN Interface","sha":null,"series":[{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","releases":["4.0.3"],"page":20,"hash":"6106e3e64cb70fc9","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","releases":["4.1.3"],"page":20,"hash":"f3661ca154536c52","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","releases":["4.2.2"],"page":20,"hash":"b3890df8336f649b","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","releases":["4.3.1"],"page":19,"hash":"9e457d6b558e1d7d","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11"],"page":18,"hash":"03a5a0eb20ffe9eb","caption":""},{"id":"SNIP_CLASSIC_ERRORDESCRIPTION_SECTION_5_2_2_2_2_CAN_Interface","releases":["R22-11"],"page":21,"hash":"50a721ea29a03767","caption":""}],"releases":["R19-11","R20-11","R21-11","R22-11","4.0.3","4.1.3","4.2.2","4.3.1"],"kind":"snippet","platform":"classic","targets":[{"role":"constitutive","conf":0.95,"rt":"API_IMPLEMENTATION","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"EXPLICIT_REFERENCE (deterministic citation)","rel":["R19-11","R22-11","4.0.3","4.1.3","4.2.2","4.3.1"],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00003"},{"role":"heuristic","conf":0.75,"rt":"","m":"gemini-3.8-flash","why":"CanIf_SetControllerMode calls Can_SetControllerMode","rel":[],"id":"SWS_CANIF_00308"}],"ok":true,"schema":"v